boot: stzos init -- machine makeen_box (hosted / aarch64 / rpi4) -- pid 1
boot: console /dev/ttyS1
boot: mount proc at /proc -- done
boot: mount sysfs at /sys -- done
boot: mount devtmpfs at /dev -- done
boot: mount ext4 at /data -- done
boot: grant network (effectful)
boot: grant filesystem (effectful)
boot: refuse gpio (effectful)
boot: start network_up -- pid N -- /stzos net eth0 192.168.10.1/24
net: eth0 -- no such interface (NODEV)
boot: network_up (pid N) exited 2
boot: kds never started -- it comes AFTER network_up, which exited 2
boot: poste never started -- it comes AFTER network_up, which exited 2
boot: every service has ended -- init has nothing left to keep alive
boot: init halts the machine -- reboot(RESTART)
reboot: Restarting system
